 "what": "Confirmatory pooled medians, in milliseconds, for every DCU campaign that reached a qualified endpoint, one row per task, plus the Compiler revision every campaign ran at whether it qualified anything or not. Retained so the numbers in F-2026-09-18-002, -003 and -005 are derived from data rather than restated from a previous sentence: the floor count was asserted in prose twice before it was right, and a second count in the same record -- how many runs rose above the floor -- was wrong as well.",
